Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 22:12:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebrand caregiver signup as 'Apply for Job' and add APK build
 workflow

- login screen button: 'APPLY AS A CAREGIVER' -> 'APPLY FOR JOB' (work icon)
- signup screen AppBar: 'Nurse Self Signup' -> 'Apply for Job'
- localized title updated in all 8 languages
- .github/workflows/build-apk.yml builds the APK on GitHub Actions
